source: tests/help.rs
expression: text
---
Print the visit history, newest first, as tab-separated lines

Usage: furet history [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --session <SESSION>  Terminal session to list, numbered like `f -N` (0 = current)
  -a, --all                List every session's visits, without numbers
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>      Maximum number of lines; 0 prints them all [default: 20]
  -h, --help               Print help
